# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Every one of these is optional: with none of them set the game
# runs exactly as it does today, with analytics and purchases inert.

# PostHog PROJECT API key — the public, write-only one, which begins phc_.
# Find it at PostHog > Settings > Project > Project API key.
# A phx_ (personal) or phs_ (project secret) key is a credential, not a project id: the build
# refuses them, because this bundle is served from a public page and anyone could read it.
# Without any key nothing is sent anywhere and only the in-memory ring buffer fills.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
# Only needed off US cloud, e.g. https://eu.i.posthog.com
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=

# RevenueCat public SDK key, for in-app purchases on a device.
VITE_REVENUECAT_KEY=
